  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Miftah-Advancing Youth and Women Peace and Security in the West Bank and Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MIFTAH&#x2019;s strategic objectives: 1. to enhance policies and practices in line with civil rights and social justice in Palestine as one pillar of good governance and 2. To enhance promotion of the Palestinian narrative at the international level. More specifically, the proposed project aims at the advancement of the Women, Peace and Security (WPS) Agenda, and empowerment of youth to promote the Palestinian narrative and enhance women political participation.</narrative>
  </description>
